# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Team shared environment — this file is committed on purpose (not accidental).
#
# You work on a team. Put variables here that everyone needs to run the app
# locally after a clone — shared dev keys, feature toggles, service URLs, etc.
#
# Your own overrides or extra secrets? Use .env.local instead (.env.* is gitignored).
#
# Production values live in your host's env settings (e.g. Vercel → Environment
# Variables). Don't put prod secrets in this file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

